---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About" description="Napa Walks is a downtown Napa walking tour company run by Team Morales and Grow Shark Media, built on real vendor relationships and small-group routes.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">About Napa Walks</div>
      <h1>Built by people who<br>actually work downtown.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Napa Walks isn't a tour-bus operation with a script. It's four routes through downtown Napa, each one built around real relationships with the shops, bars, and restaurants along the way.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="trust">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="item"><span class="dot"></span>Groups capped at 10 guests</div>
      <div class="item"><span class="dot"></span>Locally owned &amp; operated</div>
      <div class="item"><span class="dot"></span>Fully insured walking tours</div>
      <div class="item"><span class="dot"></span>Rain-or-shine, easy reschedule</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">The Idea</div>
        <h2>Napa on foot, at a human pace</h2>
        <p>Downtown Napa is small enough to walk and dense enough that a car mostly gets in the way. Napa Walks routes people through it on foot, in small groups, with a local host who knows the stops personally.</p>
      </div>
      <p style="max-width:640px; font-size:15px; color:var(--muted);">
        Each route is built around four stops, a fixed length, and a story worth telling &mdash; not a rotating list of whoever paid for placement.
        That's the whole model: walk less than two miles, hit four real local businesses, and leave knowing downtown Napa a lot better than when you started.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section how">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">Who Runs This</div>
        <h2>Team Morales &times; Grow Shark Media</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="how-grid">
        <div class="how-step">
          <div class="stamp-num">01</div>
          <h4>Team Morales</h4>
          <p>Operating partner on marketing and day-to-day delivery &mdash; the local relationships that make each route work.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step">
          <div class="stamp-num">02</div>
          <h4>Grow Shark Media</h4>
          <p>Digital, brand, and creative support &mdash; the site, the booking flow, and the systems behind the scenes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step">
          <div class="stamp-num">03</div>
          <h4>Downtown Napa businesses</h4>
          <p>Every stop on every route is a working partnership with a real, named business &mdash; not a paid ad slot.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="cta">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cta-block cta-single">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Ready to walk?</div>
          <h2>See the four routes</h2>
          <p style="max-width:480px;">Sip &amp; Nibble, Hops &amp; Bites, Heritage Walk, and Boutique Row &mdash; pick the one that fits your afternoon.</p>
          <a href="/tours" class="btn-primary" style="background:var(--stamp); border-color:var(--stamp);">SEE ALL TOURS</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
